{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(concat "Welcome to " (brandName) "!") }}

{{!--
  The welcome email where a new account is ready the moment it signs up: a
  self-hosted server (billing off) marks every address verified at sign-up
  and takes the person straight to the Dashboard (Authentication's /signup).
  So it asks for nothing, and opens the Dashboard. OneUptime Cloud asks for
  the address first, with SignupWelcomeEmail (#7988).

  Its help is the server's own, never OneUptime's support address:
  whoever runs this server is who can help with it - its support address,
  where its admins set one (serverSupportEmail, #10941), else its admin. Written out here, since
  this email is only ever sent by a self-hosted server; every other email
  there says the same through Partials/SupportBlock (#8190).
  The first account on a server is its master admin (isMasterAdmin "true"),
  who is that person, and is shown where the server's settings are instead.
--}}

{{> InfoBlock info="Thank you for signing up! Your account is ready, and there is nothing to verify. Open it to create your first project, or to accept an invitation to one."}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=dashboardLink buttonText=(concat "Open " (brandName))}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=dashboardLink linkLabel="Or copy and paste this link into your browser:"}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{#ifCond isMasterAdmin "true"}}
{{> InfoBlock info="You are this server's admin: its settings, such as email and who can sign up, are in the Admin Dashboard."}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=adminDashboardLink buttonText="Open Admin Dashboard" secondary=true}}
{{else}}
{{#if @root.serverSupportEmail}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttMailtoHtml "Need help? Write to {{address}}." address=@root.serverSupportEmail)}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Need help? Ask your server's admin."}}
{{/if}}
{{/ifCond}}

{{> Footer this}}

{{> End this}}
